          "bbox": [
            151.8,
            590.33,
            477.16,
            603.62
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "Times-Roman"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            9.96
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "J(±2, n) with |n| ⩾2.",
          "bbox": [
            152.28,
            602.21,
            235.41,
            622.11
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "Times-Italic",
            "Times-Roman",
            "rtxmi",
            "txsy",
            "txsya"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            9.96
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(2) If we rotate the diagram of J(2, n) by a 90 degrees angle clockwise then we get",
          "bbox": [
            135.24,
            614.21,
            477.01,
            627.5
          ],
