          ],
          "sizes": [
            9.96
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(1) The knot groups Π(J(2, 2m + 1)) and Π(J(2, −2m)) are isomorphic by",
          "bbox": [
            181.32,
            116.69,
            477.06,
            136.58
